   "title": "Airbnb's New York Photo Shoot: Doing Things That Don't Scale",
   "hook": "Airbnb's growth jumped once the founders flew across the country and took nicer photos of hosts' apartments themselves.",
   "source": "The Airbnb Story — Leigh Gallagher (Ch. 2, \"Building a Business\")",
   "book": "The Airbnb Story",
