   "hook": "Bezos banned slide decks and made executives write full memos, then read them in silence at the start of meetings.",
   "source": "The Everything Store — Brad Stone (Prologue; Ch. 7, \"A Technology Company, Not a Retailer\")",
   "book": "The Everything Store",
