   "title": "Apple Doesn't Sell Computers First. It Sells a Belief.",
   "hook": "Rewrite Apple's pitch in the order most companies use and it suddenly sounds like everyone else, which is the whole secret of the Golden Circle.",
   "source": "Start with Why — Simon Sinek (Ch. 3, \"The Golden Circle\")",
