   "hook": "A Japanese barbershop stripped the emotion out of a haircut and a Mexican cement giant poured emotion into a bag of cement, and both found blue oceans by flipping what their industry appealed to.",
   "source": "Blue Ocean Strategy — W. Chan Kim & Renée Mauborgne (Ch. 3, \"Reconstruct Market Boundaries\")",
   "book": "Blue Ocean Strategy",
