   "title": "A $500 Handshake and a Trunk Full of Tigers",
   "hook": "Knight sent two pairs of shoes to his old coach hoping for an order, and got a partner instead. Then he found out he could sell after all.",
   "source": "Shoe Dog — Phil Knight (1963 and 1964)",
