   "title": "\"But Everyone Else Has One\": Breaking a Collective Action Trap",
   "hook": "No parent wants to be the only one whose kid has no phone, which is exactly why every kid ends up with one.",
   "source": "The Anxious Generation — Jonathan Haidt",
   "book": "The Anxious Generation",
