   "title": "From Doormat to Partner: How Givers Stop Getting Exploited",
   "hook": "A consultant who said yes to everyone nearly stalled her own career, and Grant's three tools (sincerity screening, generous tit for tat and advocating for others) show how givers stay generous without becoming chumps.",
   "source": "Give and Take — Adam Grant (Ch. 7, \"Chump Change\")",
   "book": "Give and Take",
   "concepts": [
    "giving-and-reciprocity",
    "game-theory",
    "trust-and-reputation"
   ],
