   "hook": "A tiny steelmaker built its plants in farm country, hired people for their work ethic rather than their steel experience, paid them by what their teams produced, and overtook the mighty Bethlehem Steel.",
   "source": "Good to Great — Jim Collins (Ch. 3, \"First Who... Then What\")",
   "book": "Good to Great",
