   "hook": "Greenwald expected to meet a senior intelligence veteran; instead, a 29-year-old holding a Rubik's Cube walked up to him.",
   "source": "No Place to Hide — Glenn Greenwald (Ch. 2, \"Ten Days in Hong Kong\")",
