   "title": "Pixar's Atrium: Keeping Ideas in Motion",
   "hook": "An idea standing still gets run over, so the best organisations design buildings, habits and teams that keep ideas colliding, changing and, when necessary, dying.",
   "source": "The Idea Hunter — Andy Boynton & Bill Fischer (\"Agile\")",
