   "title": "Is Divorce Underrated? How Freedom to Leave Makes Marriages Better",
   "hook": "When American states made it possible for either spouse to end a marriage alone, the feared collapse of the family did not arrive; instead, fewer women took their own lives, and Harford argues that the freedom to leave improved the marriages that stayed together.",
