   "title": "The Firefighter Who Lit a Fire to Survive",
   "hook": "As a wildfire raced up a Montana hillside, foreman Wagner Dodge survived by doing something nobody had taught him: he set a fire of his own and lay down in the ashes.",
   "source": "Think Again — Adam Grant (Prologue)",
   "book": "Think Again",
