   "title": "Mittal's Contrarian Bet: Buying the Steel Mills Nobody Wanted",
   "hook": "While others fled a dying industry, Lakshmi Mittal built a global empire by buying failing steel plants cheaply and fixing them.",
   "source": "Cold Steel — Tim Bouquet & Byron Ousey (Mittal's early years, Indonesia, Trinidad and the turnaround playbook)",
   "book": "Cold Steel",
