   "title": "Whisper Wins, Shout Mistakes: Netflix Opens the Books",
   "hook": "Netflix shows its financial results to employees before Wall Street sees them, and asks its leaders to broadcast their own mistakes, on the theory that people treated as trusted adults behave like them.",
