   "title": "$170 to Buy, $2,400 to Sell: The Duke Basketball Tickets",
   "hook": "Duke students who camped for weeks to win basketball tickets valued them at roughly fourteen times what equally devoted students who lost the lottery would pay for them.",
   "source": "Predictably Irrational — Dan Ariely (\"The High Price of Ownership\")",
   "book": "Predictably Irrational",
