   "title": "The Plastic-Wrapped Laptop: Why Your Calm Self Can't Predict Your Hot Self",
   "hook": "Berkeley students answered the same questions twice, once calm and once aroused, and the gap between their two selves was so large that Ariely compared it to Dr. Jekyll and Mr. Hyde.",
   "source": "Predictably Irrational — Dan Ariely (\"The Influence of Arousal\")",
   "book": "Predictably Irrational",
