   "title": "The Cement Chemist Who Rescued the Oil Spill Engineers",
   "hook": "Oil-industry experts couldn't get frozen crude out of Alaskan recovery barges for years, and the answer came from a chemist who knew how to keep concrete from setting.",
   "source": "Range — David Epstein (Ch. 8, \"The Outsider Advantage\")",
