   "hook": "NASA lost two space shuttles to warning signs it had seen many times before, because every safe return had quietly taught it that the danger was acceptable.",
   "source": "Think Like a Rocket Scientist — Ozan Varol (Ch. 9, \"Nothing Fails Like Success\")",
   "book": "Think Like a Rocket Scientist",
