   "title": "Six Ways to Make a Sale Without Earning a Customer",
   "hook": "Price cuts, promotions, fear, aspiration, peer pressure and novelty all work, Sinek admits, and that is exactly why companies get hooked on them and never build loyalty.",
   "source": "Start with Why — Simon Sinek (Ch. 2, \"Carrots and Sticks\")",
