   "title": "Sandra Bland: How a Traffic Stop Went Wrong",
   "hook": "A Texas trooper stopped a young woman for not signalling a lane change, and Gladwell shows how all three of our mistakes about strangers turned a routine stop into an arrest that ended with her death.",
   "source": "Talking to Strangers — Malcolm Gladwell (Ch. 12, \"Sandra Bland\")",
