   "title": "The Schoolkids Who Just Needed Glasses",
   "hook": "While experts argued about how to fix struggling schools, a simple experiment in rural China found that many children couldn't see the blackboard.",
   "source": "Think Like a Freak — Steven Levitt & Stephen Dubner (Ch. 5, \"Think Like a Child\")",
   "book": "Think Like a Freak",
