   "title": "The Time Revolution: Most of Your Results Come From a Sliver of Your Time",
   "hook": "Koch argues we don't have too little time; we have plenty, and we waste most of it on things that barely matter.",
   "source": "The 80/20 Principle — Richard Koch (Ch. 10, \"Time Revolution\")",
   "book": "The 80/20 Principle",
