   "hook": "Mao's Great Leap Forward starved tens of millions, but a group of desperate villagers who secretly split their farmland helped start the greatest escape from poverty in history.",
   "source": "The Undercover Economist — Tim Harford (Ch. 10, \"How China Grew Rich\")",
