   "title": "Vitol in Libya: Selling Fuel to a Rebellion",
   "hook": "In the middle of a civil war, an oil trader agreed to supply fuel to rebels who had no government, no bank and no guarantee they would win.",
   "source": "The World for Sale — Javier Blas & Jack Farchy",
