   "title": "Adam Grant Passed on Warby Parker, and Got the Lesson Backwards",
   "hook": "Grant turned down a chance to invest in Warby Parker because the founders were playing it safe, and that caution turned out to be exactly why they succeeded.",
   "source": "Originals — Adam Grant (Ch. 1, \"Creative Destruction\")",
