   "title": "The Four Lessons Silicon Valley Learned From the Dot-Com Crash, and Why Thiel Thinks They Were Wrong",
   "hook": "After the 2000 crash, the survivors drew four sensible-sounding rules about building startups, and Thiel argues that the opposite of each one is closer to the truth.",
