   "title": "It's Not Luck",
   "hook": "Alex Rogo is told to polish three companies so the board can sell them, and he uses a set of simple thinking tools to turn a no-win order into wins for his companies, his customers, his people and his own family.",
   "source": "It's Not Luck (The Goal 2) — Eliyahu Goldratt",
   "book": "It's Not Luck (The Goal 2)",
   "concepts": [],
