   "title": "Outliers: The Story of Success",
   "hook": "Successful people do not rise on their own; they are the product of hidden advantages, lucky timing, enormous amounts of practice and the cultural habits they inherit, which means success is far less about who you are and far more about where, when and how you grew up.",
   "source": "Outliers — Malcolm Gladwell",
