   "title": "Sapiens: A Brief History of Humankind",
   "hook": "An unremarkable African ape learned to believe in things that don't exist, and that single talent let it take over the planet, invent money, empires and science, and now edge toward redesigning itself.",
   "source": "Sapiens — Yuval Noah Harari",
   "book": "Sapiens",
