   "title": "The Tipping Point: How Little Things Can Make a Big Difference",
   "hook": "Ideas, products, behaviours and crimes spread like viruses, and if you understand the few people, the sticky messages and the small details of context that drive an epidemic, you can tip one with a surprisingly small push.",
