   "title": "The Toyota Way: 14 Management Principles from the World's Greatest Manufacturer",
   "hook": "Toyota's secret is not a set of factory tricks like kanban cards or andon cords. It is a way of thinking about people, problems and the long term, and the tools only work when that thinking comes first.",
   "source": "The Toyota Way — Jeffrey Liker",
