   "title": "Think Like a Rocket Scientist: Simple Strategies You Can Use to Make Giant Leaps in Work and Life",
   "hook": "Rocket science is not really about rockets: it is a way of thinking (embrace uncertainty, strip problems to their basics, test ruthlessly, and learn from both failure and success) that anyone can borrow for ordinary work and life.",
   "source": "Think Like a Rocket Scientist — Ozan Varol",
